      "raw": "So, last night I was playing a game with Expatriette. She had a Speed Loading in play and a Ammo in hand. Speed Loading states that at the start of her turn, Expat can play 1 Ammo. The rules of the game state that if you do not play a card or use a power during your turn, you draw two cards during your draw step.\r\n\r\nMy question is this: If I use Speed Loading to play my Ammo, but do not play a card during my play step, do I draw one or two cards? My guess is that I only draw one card since it Ammo was played instead of being put into play (even though it was outside my play step), but I am not sure if there is a hidden rule that I'm not seeing.",
