      "raw": "[quote=\"Kingofsouls\"]\n\nSo, last night I was playing a game with Expatriette. She had a Speed Loading in play and a Ammo in hand. Speed Loading states that at the start of her turn, Expat can play 1 Ammo. The rules of the game state that if you do not play a card or use a power during your turn, you draw two cards during your draw step.\n\nMy question is this: If I use Speed Loading to play my Ammo, but do not play a card during my play step, do I draw one or two cards? My guess is that I only draw one card since it Ammo was played instead of being put into play (even though it was outside my play step), but I am not sure if there is a hidden rule that I&#39;m not seeing.\n\n[/quote]\n\nThe way I interpret the rule is you must skip your &quot;play phase&quot; and your &quot;power phase&quot;. If you got to play a card during your SoT Phase, I don&#39;t think that counts.\n",
