      "raw": "[quote=\"Ronway\"]\n\nIt can be tested. Have Omnitron-X have Slip Through Time in play while Fixed Point is in play, Skip the Play and Power phases , draw two cards, and see if you can play and use a power at the End of Turn phase.\n\n[/quote]\n\nJust did the above. After skipping my play and power phase I did indeed draw 2 cards then was able to play and use another power. Based on the Video Game, the Draw an additonal card rule only applies to phases before the Draw phase, not what happens afterwards. So if Wager Master reversed turn order and you didn&#39;t draw during the End of Turn phase, then you would totally be able to draw an additional card on the Draw phase.\n",
